            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layup Legends™ is a basket-brawler for up to 4 players. Play with your friends or CPUs in 1v1 and 2v2 matches across a variety of stages. <strong>ATTACK</strong> to keep your opponents away from the ball while you <strong>THROW</strong>, <strong>DUNK</strong>, and <strong>LAYUP</strong> your way to victory. Choose from one of 9 unique <strong>SUPERS</strong> to devastate your opponents. Infuse the ball with <strong>SUPER CHARGE</strong> to unleash a powerful<strong> SUPER DUNK</strong> that can be thrown in any direction at breakneck speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play up to 4-player local matches with your friends or CPUs in<strong> VERSUS MODE</strong>. Every match will earn you coins to unlock new heads!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the <strong>COLLECTION</strong> to see all the heads you own. You can unlock new heads by using coins you've earned, or by completing challenges. There are 100 heads of different rarities and styles, all unlockable by playing the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head<strong> ONLINE</strong> to play with your friends in<strong> CUSTOM GAMES</strong>. Or challenge new opponents in<strong> MATCHMAKING</strong>. Layup Legends™ uses<strong> ROLLBACK</strong> networking for a smooth online experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete<strong> DAILY CHALLENGES</strong> to earn extra coins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your best moments with<strong> REPLAYS</strong>. Adjust the camera to find a perfect angle for a screenshot! Scrub back and forth through the replay to find just the moment you're looking for, or watch it back in slow-motion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice every aspect of Layup Legends™ in<strong> TRAINING MODE</strong>. Whether you want to view hitboxes, see ball and knockback paths, or change your super on the fly the <strong>TRAINING MODE</strong> is filled with useful tools to help you practice your skills!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layup Legends™ is a basket-brawler for up to 4 players. Play with your friends or CPUs in 1v1 and 2v2 matches across a variety of stages. <strong>ATTACK</strong> to keep your opponents away from the ball while you <strong>THROW</strong>, <strong>DUNK</strong>, and <strong>LAYUP</strong> your way to victory. Choose from one of 9 unique <strong>SUPERS</strong> to devastate your opponents. Infuse the ball with <strong>SUPER CHARGE</strong> to unleash a powerful<strong> SUPER DUNK</strong> that can be thrown in any direction at breakneck speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play up to 4-player local matches with your friends or CPUs in<strong> VERSUS MODE</strong>. Every match will earn you coins to unlock new heads!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the <strong>COLLECTION</strong> to see all the heads you own. You can unlock new heads by using coins you've earned, or by completing challenges. There are 100 heads of different rarities and styles, all unlockable by playing the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head<strong> ONLINE</strong> to play with your friends in<strong> CUSTOM GAMES</strong>. Or challenge new opponents in<strong> MATCHMAKING</strong>. Layup Legends™ uses<strong> ROLLBACK</strong> networking for a smooth online experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete<strong> DAILY CHALLENGES</strong> to earn extra coins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your best moments with<strong> REPLAYS</strong>. Adjust the camera to find a perfect angle for a screenshot! Scrub back and forth through the replay to find just the moment you're looking for, or watch it back in slow-motion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice every aspect of Layup Legends™ in<strong> TRAINING MODE</strong>. Whether you want to view hitboxes, see ball and knockback paths, or change your super on the fly the <strong>TRAINING MODE</strong> is filled with useful tools to help you practice your skills!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "short_description": "The basket-brawler for up to 4 players! Use your skills to outplay your opponents on a variety of stages. Unleash powerful super moves to destroy your enemies and become a Layup Legend. Play with your friends or CPUs in 1v1 and 2v2 matches locally or online.",
